# Subagent delegation

| Agent | Delegate when | Do not delegate when |
|---|---|---|
| `win32-interop` | New/changed P/Invoke, WinEvent hooks, HICON handling, UIPI/elevation quirks, DPI math | Pure XAML/MVVM, docs, packaging |
| `wpf-mvvm-ui` | XAML layout, styles, bindings, view models, settings UI | Native interop, tray lifetime, releases |
| `tray-lifecycle` | NotifyIcon creation/disposal, hidden-window bookkeeping, crash recovery, restore-all, elevation handoff | Visual styling, rule-matching logic |
| `release-docs` | README/CHANGELOG updates after feature changes, version bumps, publish settings | Code-only refactors with no user-visible change |
| `path-map` | Settings, hotkeys, elevation, watchdog, or Windows integration paths change | Isolated UI edits |

For trivial one-line fixes, skip delegation and edit directly.
